<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES LATEST.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest scores from the women's</p>
<p>singles semifinals at Wimbledon on Thursday:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>Hingis won 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Playing later:</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) v 8-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain)</p>
